# Project Structure

- Keep implementation code under `disclo/` monorepo root.
- Keep workspace governance files at workspace root (`docs/`, `.cursor/rules/`, `CLAUDE.md`).
- Place platform UIs in `disclo/apps/embedded/*`.
- Place shared engine logic in `disclo/packages/core`.
